       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "We talked about a hybrid approach where datastreams are saved directly as disseminations off the objects, and other disseminations are reached through the cmodel, bdef, dissType arcs.  Also the dates would be the last mod dates of the objects.  ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Attached a pic of the whiteboard after our meeting (Dan, Chris, Eddie) on Tuesday afternoon.",
